    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It sounds like you're saying the debate is pretty much settled then, and the only real issue is how they're implemented. But if the research is so \"strong,\" why are so many executives and economists still skeptical about the actual ROI? Shouldn't we be looking at the criticisms that these mandates can actually hurt meritocracy or create more friction in teams rather than just assuming it works if done \"right\"?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
